notes:
Files: web/src/components/ui/{Combobox.tsx,Combobox.css,Combobox.test.tsx,comboboxStyleContract.test.ts,index.ts}, web/src/pages/{Diff.tsx,Diff.test.tsx}
Approach: New generic ui/Combobox primitive (items/value/onSelect/itemId/itemLabel/itemSub). Filter is case-insensitive AND-of-terms over label+sub, synchronous — NOT debounced via Toolbar, because the candidates are already in memory and a debounce would only add lag; what is borrowed from Toolbar is the shape, not its search-param state model (a diff selection is a component-local signal). Keyboard: Arrow up/down wrap, Enter commits, Escape closes without changing the selection; options commit on mousedown (click fires after focusout). Diff.tsx swaps all four selects for Comboboxes; SBOM options carry the digest as sub-label so a digest prefix is searchable. The arch coupling and 'show all architectures' checkbox (ADR-019) are untouched.
Verification: 557 tests / 62 files (Diff 5, Combobox 9, style contract 4), lint 0 errors (5 pre-existing warnings), tsc clean. Live on the prod-proxy rig :3100 — From artifact 50 options narrowed to 5 by typing 'flux controller' (two out-of-order terms); From SBOM 200 options narrowed to 1 by 'arm64 v1.6.3'; a known pair (helm-controller v1.6.2 -> v1.6.3 arm64) still renders +1/-1/7-upgraded unchanged.
